as","/farmland-atlas/south-dakota/spink-county"],["ARC or PLC in Spink County","/arc-plc/south-dakota/spink-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Spink County record runs from 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids. In 2025, that same pair ran 23% of normal on the middle of the grids, while July to August ran 165%. In 2026 so far, June to July is at 121% on the middle of the grids. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, and grid 29829 went down to 46% of normal that year.</p>"}
